      "title": "Trace investigation workflow",
      "type": "text",
      "description": "Trace investigation workflow",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "1. Select service/environment and inspect HTTP latency.\n2. Open a Tempo search below, narrow time range and inspect a SERVER span.\n3. Use its trace-to-logs action; expand a log and use TraceID \u2192 View trace for the reverse direction.\n\n[Search selected services](/explore?schemaVersion=1&panes=%7B%22trace%22%3A%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22tempo%22%7D%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%7B%20resource.service.name%20%3D~%20%5C%22${service:regex}%5C%22%20%26%26%20resource.deployment.environment.name%20%3D~%20%5C%22${environment:regex}%5C%22%20%7D%22%7D%5D%2C%22range%22%3A%7B%22from%22%3A%22now-1h%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22now%22%7D%7D%7D&orgId=1)\n\n[Slow requests (>1 second)](/explore?schemaVersion=1&panes=%7B%22trace%22%3A%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22tempo%22%7D%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%7B%20resource.service.name%20%3D~%20%5C%22${service:regex}%5C%22%20%26%26%20resource.deployment.environment.name%20%3D~%20%5C%22${environment:regex}%5C%22%20%26%26%20duration%20%3E%201s%20%7D%22%7D%5D%2C%22range%22%3A%7B%22from%22%3A%22now-1h%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22now%22%7D%7D%7D&orgId=1)\n\n[Error traces](/explore?schemaVersion=1&panes=%7B%22trace%22%3A%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22tempo%22%7D%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%7B%20resource.service.name%20%3D~%20%5C%22${service:regex}%5C%22%20%26%26%20resource.deployment.environment.name%20%3D~%20%5C%22${environment:regex}%5C%22%20%26%26%20status%20%3D%20error%20%7D%22%7D%5D%2C%22range%22%3A%7B%22from%22%3A%22now-1h%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22now%22%7D%7D%7D&orgId=1)\n\n10% root sampling remains unchanged. No service graph, span-metrics pipeline or TraceQL metrics generator is enabled. HTTP 4xx need not set span status=error. Search and waterfall UI interactions require manual browser verification."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
